  "body": "A way to http `PATCH` to modify state events.\r\n\r\nSimilar to the following:\r\n\r\n```http\r\nPATCH /rooms/$ROOM_ID/state/m.room.power_levels HTTP/1.1\r\n\r\n{\r\n    \"users\": {\r\n        \"@foo:bar.baz\": 100\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe request json would be merged with the current json and be used for the new state event.",
